{"dog":{"age_group":"senior","application_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Unknown","breed_primary":"Unknown","description_text":"Rusty loves to chill out! He is sweet, affectionate dog. His favorite activities are sleeping, occasionally chewing on chews and staring out the window. He enjoys walks - he is still very stimulated by the sights and sounds of a new neighborhood, but each walk he pulls less and less. We do not interact with other dogs, but he does bark at them, but he loves people! He loves to be snuggled, belly rubs and head massages.\n\n﻿Rusty is approximately 9y 0m 18d old and is fully grown at 55 pounds. They are microchipped and up to date on all age-appropriate medical care. Their breed is unknown as we have not had a DNA test done.\n\nAlthough our dogs are listed as unknown breed, buildings with specific dog restrictions typically enforce their rules based on what breeds a dog appears to resemble. It's always important to keep that in mind and know your building's policies before adopting a dog.\n\nThis dog is available for adoption through Muddy Paws Rescue. If you're interested in adopting, the first thing you should do is begin the registration process at www.muddypawsrescue.org. If you are already a registered adopter with Muddy Paws Rescue, please email us at adoptionmeetings@muddypawsrescue.org.","detail_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adoptable?dog=006203","id":"077978f74d761fd667012d99a7aae7c2","image_urls":["https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/R/RustySFCreateDate20221022/i-XCRzDcL/0/NSstr5Bngbq9P8Ck6f437Z7z8wPJ95z7hKc6LZSVJ/X2/IMG_7267-X2.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/R/RustySFCreateDate20221022/i-smv56qb/0/K4w5fqtP6KNxVMCX2bM7LpxbPhfSrPTPdHXXqZBdN/XL/CE4F7966-1158-4C3A-8DA8-887D1F0D6A34-XL.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/R/RustySFCreateDate20221022/i-27LCwLm/0/MhkTmMrV2v8ShJrCGk76bFZDNpj9NCCsm5CF3SbqS/4K/9F2BD3